<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Comparatif designs - Andre Schlegel</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #0f1318;
        --panel: #171d25;
        --ink: #f0f2f6;
        --muted: #96a2b0;
        --accent: #d9a15f;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        background: linear-gradient(140deg, #10151d, #0f1318 48%, #1b1f27);
        color: var(--ink);
      }
      main {
        width: min(1040px, 92vw);
        margin: 0 auto;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 2rem 0;
      }
      h1 { margin-top: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3rem); }
      p { color: var(--muted); }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        margin-top: 1.2rem;
      }
      a {
        display: block;
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        border: 1px solid #2a3342;
        background: var(--panel);
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: transform .25s ease, border-color .25s ease;
      }
      a:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--accent); }
      small { color: var(--accent); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Propositions de design - Site historique 2de guerre mondiale</h1>
      <p>Trois versions de page ont ete generees a partir du brief. Chaque page integre des sections narratives, du contenu factice date sur 1939/1942/1944, des images placeholder et une carte MapLibre GL.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <a href="/design-1">
          <small>Option 1</small>
          <h2>Archives cinematographiques</h2>
          <p>Ambiance sombre, progression verticale lumineuse et reveals immersifs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/design-2">
          <small>Option 2</small>
          <h2>Dossier militaire annote</h2>
          <p>Univers papier, tampons visuels et timeline type rapport classe.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/design-3">
          <small>Option 3</small>
          <h2>Memorial cartographique moderne</h2>
          <p>Interface museale claire, panneaux modules et accents cartographiques.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
